# better-auth 1.6.26, root and client/ (mctl-academy#540). GHSA-965c-763c-88jm:
# an OAuth state value is accepted as a Magic Link token. Exploitable only when
# the Magic Link plugin is enabled; academy enables genericOAuth alone and has
# no Magic Link plugin. The fix (1.7.7) changes the genericOAuth server and
# client API, so it is an auth migration rather than a lockfile bump.
